        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nii) MEDICAL EXPENSES:"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a68e41d14da448debcd49b238ff828b2_95",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nThe Petitioner has pleaded that he has spent a sum of Rs.3,00,000/- towards treatment, medicines,\nconveyance, food SCCH - 25 11 MVC No.1737/2023 and nourishment and other incidental expenses etc."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "eaa56eeab4d348a087bf2390ad94cdac_96",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In this regard, he has produced medical bills as per Ex.P.9 for a sum of Rs.1,09,940/- There is no contrary evidence against these bills from the Respondents."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f3122722af6b4a288e78c0cb9a342ad2_97",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, the petitioner is entitled for the above said amount under this head."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "15545da082474600ab9f9ebe47e26b34_98",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\niii) LOSS OF INCOME DURING LAID UP PERIOD:-\nAs mentioned above the petitioner has sustained grievous injuries."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0f64769063eb41abb2cdfbbfb4d69149_99",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The petitioner has produced discharge summary of Govt. Hospital, Tiptur to show the details of treatment in the said hospital."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "56645d42852c48a8a26a45fc9f0fa650_100",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, considering the nature of injuries it can be said that the Petitioner may have required at least One month time for recovering from the injuries sustained by him."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "502eb308ab7f466ab76f77a7571c7a22_101",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, he is entitled only for a sum of Rs.16,000/- under this head."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "96dc8adc986c42829bbab018d9632044_102",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\niv) LOSS OF FUTURE INCOME:-\nOn perusal of Ex.P.11 as well as Affidavit, the petitioner's age is mentioned as 34 years."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "bd63ebcaf8c546e3819e8f9d8a12514c_103",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, as on the date of the accident the Petitioner's age is 34 years."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a2e5eff63c0d42d6a8e4b7db8be3e996_104",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per the dictum laid SCCH - 25 12 MVC No.1737/2023 down in Sarala Verma's case the appropriate multiplier applicable to his age is 16."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c8737e78f21f4a47bcf3c191e6244d2d_105",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, the Petitioner is entitled for a sum of Rs.4,30,080/- (Rs.16,000/- x 12 x 16 x 14%= Rs.4,30,080/-) under this head."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d6623432604c4a11abe50a498f259852_106",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
